the two kings of  monster movies are facing each other in  2021  that is if 2020 doesn't end with an  apocalyptic event  but before anything like that happens  let us update you with the three titans  that are confirmed to appear in the  movie  excluding kong and godzilla this will be  a short video as not much information  is leaked or given to us with most of  the speculations and confirmation is  from the toy images of godzilla vs kong  that were leaked  there are also tidbits of info that were  in the redacted wordings and mid-credit  scenes of king of the monsters  we sure hope that there will be more of  these talents that would be shown in the  movie  next year but till now we will have to  contend with the five that are known  so the first one is nozuki or warbat  the first item is as some have known  since april or earlier this year  this is an original monster vs thailand  got nozuki  and later renamed as warbat this  creature would likely not be the only  one of its kind but might be a  swarm-like species called the nuzuki  following a bigger specimen called the  warbat but then again  that's just our speculation his or her  body seems to be mostly green colored  with a red underbelly but  the earlier toy that was released  earlier looked brownish  tan in color this nuzuki or otherwise  called warbat appears to be like a  winged serpent like creature with yellow  and red coloured wings  if it is closely inspected we would see  that the serpent has strange wings that  jut  out from the spines of the creature  these wings are most probably used for  either gliding or for intimidation  and not for flying and come to think  about that a titan that big would glide  from where exactly  okay so this fact is clear that the most  of us prides itself  in putting a realistic feel into the  designs of the titans  they could also be frills that make the  creature look bigger than it really is  for intimidation  or would be used for moving in the  hollow earth or underwater  only time will tell so this serpent also  has a long slender body that would be  hundreds of meters long  as it was not seen and awaken or even  hearing guidorus or godzilla's alpha  call it will probably be another  alpha-class titan that refuses to join  the other beaters  as for the location of where it resides  or hibernates is up to debate  mid-credits scenes clippings of  coordinates pointing towards  gobekli tepe in southern turkey might be  one probable area  and another one might be that it will be  awakened when humans venture into the  hollow earth  with the heav or the hollow earth  anti-gravity vehicle  beneath skull island so going to the  second one  we have the alpha skull crawler so up  next we have this big skull crawler  one which is rumored to be even bigger  than the one that fought kong  in the 2017 skull island movie like most  other skull crawlers which are  large reptilian creatures with only two  four limbs and no hind limbs as well as  long  prehensile serpentine tails and they  also have  long slender yet muscular sturdy bodies  several aspects of their  appearances are noticeably skeletal  particularly  their torsos and their heads and this  new one  seen as a part of the leaked toy images  seems to be just like the older ones but  with small minor changes  this new skull crawler or as i would  like to call it the alpha skull crawler  has reddish skin on its back and it  starts from the base of the head  and the neck what does it mean we don't  know yet but it could most probably  be a coloration that an alpha of a  species attains  when it reaches a certain size or status  this alpha also has bigger arms with  more musculature  and seems to be half the height of  godzilla but equal in length  it still has its long prehensile tail  which would be a very deadly weapon  against other titans so i'm guessing  that it wouldn't be a main villain but  somewhat of a first level boss fight  that would build up the suspense before  fighting the final boss  maybe and the third titan that was  confirmed is mecca godzilla  as seen in the news clippings of  godzilla king of the monsters monarch  was actively building a mechanized titan  in order to face off  against the other super species threat  that humanity suddenly faced  in the previous movie imagine during the  events of kotm most of humanity  thought that godzilla was the only titan  alive but all of a sudden  their cities and populations face  constant attacks from these gigantic  unstoppable foes it would make sense  that humanity would pull in all their  resources  to build mechanized titans to battle  these new threats much like the jaegers  of pacific rim  so in the leaked toy images we see that  mechagodzilla has a very different  design  although not diverging far from the  original concept this maker godzilla had  robots  arms and legs and that the hands possess  oversized fingers which could use to  grab godzilla or be used to clench to  form a powerful fist for combat  this mecca also had a long reddish spiny  tail with hundreds of reddish segments  that start from the body  and to the tip the head was designed to  look like godzilla himself  in another toy we can see that a  godzilla figure wrapped by  similar reddish segments which might be  an armor or a power up  but that's for another video of  mechagodzilla and mega godzilla  differences  so that's that here we have the three  other titans that will be joining kong  and godzilla in the 2021 movie  these titans again is the snake serpent  with red wings called nozuki or warbat  the giant skull crawler that looks like  it has reddish skin  on its back and the mechanized titan  that we so  wanted badly mecha godzilla anyways  thanks mind keywords and  be sure to hit that bell button for  regular updates on monster videos

